  "body": "Since `[[abort]]` calls `[[finish]]` a consumer of a stream cannot differentiate between a stream has ended and has no more data cleanly or it was aborted prematurely.\n\nMaybe the `readableState` should also have an `\"aborted\"` state instead of a `\"finished\"` state.\n\nThis edit passes a boolean to the `finishedPromise` to let it know whether it was aborted or not.\n",
